    "id": "c013",
    "name": "ARTICLE vI — Reinsurance Premium",
    "text": "ARTICLE vI REINSURANCE PREMIUM. The Reinsured shall pay to the CORPORATION a reinsurance premium developed by the application of the appropriate rate in accordance with the Rating Schedule, attached hereto and made a part of this agreement, and subject to the applicable minimum premium specified in the Rating Schedule."
