    "text": "it is furthermore agreed that, in the determination of the amount of the lability of the reinsurer in the lquida- . tien or receivership proceeding, no judgement against an insured taken after the date of the entry of the liquidation or receivership erder shall be considered as evidence of liability, or of the amount of damages and no judgement against an insured taken by default, inquest or collusion, prior to the entry of such order shail be considered as conclusive evidence, either of the liability of such insured to such person upon such cause of action or of the - amount of darnages to which such person is therain entitled."
  },
  {
